Cell["\<\
We compute the Choi matrix of Phi. The see that all entries of this matrix \
are real which verifies that Phi maps real matrices to real matrices. We also \
find that the Choi Matrix is PSD and that rank of the Choi  matrix is 4, thus \
the Choi-Kraus rank of Phi is 4=2^2. Thus this product hits the rank lower \
bound of Corollary 6.4.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9918307262936087`*^9, 3.9918307897765417`*^9}, {
  3.991831101860304*^9, 
  3.991831107597083*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"656668a4-8ab0-4717-9541-\
0de53e1f24ad"],

