Cell["\<\
Here we confirm that the Choi matrix is generated as claimed in Proposition \
6.1. We also confirm that each matrix appearing in the Choi-Kraus \
representation of Phi has rank 1. Notice these matrices are not all real, \
which emphasizes that Phi is not real separable. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.991830800785414*^9, 3.9918308060125217`*^9}, {
  3.991830848701475*^9, 3.991830880339858*^9}, {3.991831194901105*^9, 
  3.9918311975609865`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"05451a24-20db-457f-a30c-\
22df355e2900"],

